```css
.page-products .section-title {
  font-size: 16px;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  letter-spacing: 0.08em;
}
```

It's scoped to `.page-products`, so the "All products" and "Bundles" headings change and the `section-title` headings on the other pages stay as they were. It also overrides the smaller `h2` size used on narrow screens, so the headings stay at 16px there.

